message: >-
  If you use OpenPinch, please cite the foundational article below and the
  version of the software you used (its Zenodo DOI).
type: software
title: OpenPinch
abstract: >-
  An advanced pinch analysis and total site integration toolkit: process and
  site heat integration targets, multiperiod analysis, heat pumps and
  refrigeration, cogeneration, utility placement, exergy, and heat exchanger
  network synthesis.
